{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447570/extras/mom_gif_630x338.gif?t=1744980273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447570/extras/mom_logo_630x73_B.jpg?t=1744980273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shh! Be quiet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you make a loud noise in the kitchen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before you know it, the sleeping mother will be standing behind your back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations, your appetite has beaten your fears, even in these dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now scour the kitchen to get the food you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, no matter what, you should not put the plate you are holding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447570/extras/mom_logo_630x73__3_.jpg?t=1744980273\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Tips:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the right mouse button to pick up and move things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you drop so